["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"491 埃德蒙·伯克的保守主义与渐进改革思想：从北美、法国到英属印度 rotten borough virtual representation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-11-cn2aa250-波士顿倾茶不是抗税事件-而是伦敦金融爆雷后的连锁反应/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:23:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0811</span></div>\n<h2>波士顿倾茶不是抗税事件，而是伦敦金融爆雷后的连锁反应</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">波士顿倾茶不是北美税负太重引发的抗税起义，而是伦敦金融危机通过东印度公司这个杠杆向北美转嫁的一场自救——帝国中枢的一次爆雷，最后点燃了殖民地革命的引信。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">思想史</span><span class=\"tag\">保守主义</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"284: ENCORE: Screens, Toxic Stress &amp; Staying Connected with Dr. Nadine Burke Harris ACEs toxic stress response buffering caregiving upstander\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-11-asklisa-别站在孩子和屏幕之间-要站在孩子这边/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ace27132dfc1e3aa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">47:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0811</span></div>\n<h2>别挡在孩子和屏幕之间，要站在孩子这边</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">毒性应激的真实机制是被暴露时缺少成人缓冲；越能和孩子站同一边、把技术当共同对手，关系就越能成为数字时代最强的保护。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">屏幕时间</span><span class=\"tag\">毒性应激</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Max Hodak: How Startups Build Speed eigenreviews AI-resistant homework vibe coding tropicalization\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-10-ycsp-深科技公司败给组织系统-而不是技术失败/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d5e8b9a2ac9beab2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">57:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0810</span></div>\n<h2>深科技公司败给组织系统，而不是技术失败</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">创业公司能多快迭代，决定它能赢多久；而迭代速度来自采购、招人、绩效这些「基础设施」。把审批放到预算层、绩效改成 eigenreviews，比纠结具体技术更值得投入。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">组织效率</span><span class=\"tag\">招聘机制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Swing Riots threshing machine flail Corn Laws workhouse select vestries rotten boroughs\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-10-stuffmissed-砸烂打谷机也没能换来工人好日子/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">36:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0810</span></div>\n<h2>砸烂打谷机换来252个死刑判决，工人却没赢</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">十九世纪英格兰农民以砸毁打谷机抗议失业，换来的是252人死刑判决、481人或505人流放澳洲，以及1832年有限的议会改革——工人命运没变，政治版图变了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">农业革命</span><span class=\"tag\">技术性失业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"What do we actually think about Hyperscale Silicon?? // The AI Hardware Podcast S2E9 TPU Nitro RISC-V Arm CSS\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-10-techtechpotato-超大规模自研芯片-不只为省钱-更怕被-nvidia-绑架/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/430136289cd55797-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">30:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TechTechPotato</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0810</span></div>\n<h2>自研芯片不为省钱，为摆脱 Nvidia 的代际绑架</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">超大规模厂商自研芯片的真正动机不是省钱，而是控制权：避免被 Nvidia 的代际节奏绑架，同时靠规模压缩网络和计算成本。Broadcom 税比 Nvidia 税更便宜，但只有最大玩家玩得起。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">超大规模厂商</span><span class=\"tag\">自研芯片</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"363 | Chandra Sripada on How LLMs and Humans are Cognitive Cousins production system in-weight processing in-context processing contravariance architectural canalization chain of thought\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-10-mindscape-预测是训练信号之母-llm-是认知表亲/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d69097efcbd03611-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:51:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Mindscape</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0810</span></div>\n<h2>LLM 不是自动补全，而是人类的认知表亲</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">LLM 不是花哨的自动补全，而是与人类共享核心认知原则的「认知表亲」：注意力机制复现了生产系统，预测是主导训练信号；样本效率差三四个数量级，但架构调整可能补上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">认知科学</span><span class=\"tag\">认知表亲</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Ben Sasse on Faith, Family, and Facing Death Heidelberg Catechism shared governance accelerationism safetyism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-10-econtalk-把死亡视为最后的敌人而非最终话语/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8da698e33560635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">EconTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0810</span></div>\n<h2>死亡是最后的敌人而非最终话语：前参议员借来的时间</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">晚期胰腺癌患者、前参议员 Ben Sasse 在借来的时间里受访：肿瘤已缩小超过80%，但可能无法治愈；他把死亡看作「最后的敌人而非最终话语」，并把行政越权的根源指向立法退缩。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">胰腺癌</span><span class=\"tag\">死亡观</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"We’re postliterate postliterate secondary orality syllogism epithet\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-10-grayarea-后文字时代-人人都在读-却没人再读长文/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7c8b1deddea1e240-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Gray Area</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0810</span></div>\n<h2>后文字时代：人人都在读，却没人再读长文</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国某天读过书或文章的人，二十年间少了40%；比识字危机更值得警惕的是后文字时代——抽象思维、教育方式与政治传播，正在随长篇阅读一起退场。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">后文字时代</span><span class=\"tag\">注意力经济</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Using AI to Increase Your Intelligence &amp; Enrich Humanity | Dr. Fei-Fei Li ImageNet 空间智能 具身智能 多模态\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-10-huberman-视觉是智能基石-ai应增强而非取代人的能动性/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d9e03163dcfb779e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">2:08:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Huberman Lab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0810</span></div>\n<h2>视觉是智能基石，AI应增强而非取代人的能动性</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">视觉是智能的基石；AI 必须增强人的能动性而不是取代它；人类最珍贵的认知，恰恰从未上传到互联网。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">视觉</span><span class=\"tag\">ImageNet</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Disney: The Renaissance and the Empire CAPS story reels film rentals multiplane camera\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-10-acquired-迪士尼帝国由-espn-现金牛买下-也被它拖住/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1af0576da27045e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">4:32:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Acquired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0810</span></div>\n<h2>ESPN 四年利润买下皮克斯漫威卢卡斯，也拖住了迪士尼</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">迪士尼三十年的帝国由 VHS 录像带和 ESPN 订阅费两座现金牛喂养；流媒体让结构性优势失效——IP 永生，但旧商业模式不再有。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">现金牛</span><span class=\"tag\">IP 资产</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Naval Revolution: Triumph and Disaster torpedo boat destroyer 30-knotters ram bow engine telegraph rebreather Normand boiler\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-10-historyhit-鱼雷艇用1-的战列舰成本-逼出了驱逐舰兵种/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/71b0d2c1b954a484-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">36:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0810</span></div>\n<h2>撞角撞沉自家驱逐舰：1%成本鱼雷艇催生的新兵种</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1908年，一艘380吨驱逐舰在演习中被1万吨巡洋舰撞沉，35人遇难。这起悲剧背后，是鱼雷艇用1%的战列舰成本颠覆海战，催生了驱逐舰。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">海军史</span><span class=\"tag\">驱逐舰</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"695. Elizabeth I vs The Catholics: The Shadow War (Part 5) cautionary towns fireships / hell-burners Politiques War of the Three Henrys\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-09-restishistory-philip-sidney-之死-英雄是被葬礼制造出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0809</span></div>\n<h2>Philip Sidney 死于腿伤，成名于葬礼</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英西冷战转入热战，Philip Sidney 终于在低地战场迎来成名机会，却死于一次并不致命的腿伤；让他成为新教欧洲英雄的，是葬礼而不是战功。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">伊丽莎白一世</span><span class=\"tag\">英西战争</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Dark Fiber Listening Network DAS (Distributed Acoustic Sensing) Dark Fiber OTDR (Optical Time Domain Reflectometry) VSP (Vertical Seismic Profiling) Geophone Rayleigh Scattering\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-09-asianometry-暗光纤正在把海底变成全球最大窃听网/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1e6062bb8e32bd3b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">20:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0809</span></div>\n<h2>海底光缆正变成全球最大窃听网：不是间谍，是物理</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">分布式声学传感（DAS）让普通光缆变成连续振动监听器：油气井勘测、地震监测、鲸鱼追踪、船只反潜都用同一条技术链，海洋正在快速失去隐私。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">暗光纤</span><span class=\"tag\">分布式声学传感</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The playbook for building high-talent-density teams | Adam Ward, Head of Talent at Cursor funnel of doom remainder hiring work sample / work trial talent engineer talent density pre-boarding\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-09-lennys-招聘漏斗注定招到平庸的人-10x-只存在于团队里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e5f79e19f08aa8b3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:30:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0809</span></div>\n<h2>招聘漏斗注定招到平庸的人，10X 只存在于团队里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把招聘当销售漏斗，你招到的不是最强的 20%，只是恰好那天回你消息的 20 个人。Adam Ward 说 talent density 是集体属性，没有 10X 的个人，只有 10X 的团队。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">招聘</span><span class=\"tag\">人才密度</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Shapur I: Rome&#x27;s Greatest Enemy? Shahanshah Ērānšahr Arsacid dynasty\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-09-ancients-沙普尔一世-生擒罗马皇帝的最强宿敌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/185bf0c8eb3903d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">58:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0809</span></div>\n<h2>生擒罗马皇帝的波斯王，其实是罗马自己养出的敌人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">沙普尔一世两次摧毁罗马大军并俘获皇帝瓦勒良，是罗马东方最危险的敌人；但他的胜利更多是三世纪危机的果，而非因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">萨珊波斯</span><span class=\"tag\">罗马</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Thinking in Silico: Goodfire CTO Dan Balsam on Concept Manifolds &amp; a $1000/Month ML Research Agent LRH SAE BSF Predictive Data Debugging Affective Circumplex Silico\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-08-cogrev-模型是遗留代码库-可解释性是调试器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/76fca1fe34565d53-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:57:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0808</span></div>\n<h2>模型是遗留代码库：可解释性是调试器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">数据过滤与奖励塑形其实是同一座山的两面；模型是可分解的稀疏混合，可解释性因此能直接干预训练。Goodfire 用月费 1000 美元的 Silico，把这种调试自动化了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">可解释性</span><span class=\"tag\">后训练</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Episode #251 ... You Must Change Your Life, Pt. 2 - The Worlds That Make Us co-immunity symbolic immunity vertical tension base camp anthrotechnics\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-08-philosophize-改变人生不是换信念-而是移动你的大本营/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e87b1cc15318e66e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">35:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Philosophize This!</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0808</span></div>\n<h2>改变人生不是换信念，而是搬出你亲手搭的赌场</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">人不是站在世界对面的独立主体，而是被环境、身体和符号免疫系统共同构成的产物；想改变人生，就要同时改信念、行动与世界，而不是只逼自己「想通」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">斯洛特戴克</span><span class=\"tag\">环境塑造</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"505 – The Battle of Tinchebray Orderic Vitalis Henry of Huntingdon siege castle\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-07-britishhist-亨利一世在坦什布赖靠下马步战加伏兵生擒长兄/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fdf8df11ad3c0078-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">British History Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0807</span></div>\n<h2>下马步战加伏兵：亨利一世生擒亲哥的诺曼底决战</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">亨利一世让骑士下马步战，再用隐蔽的第四梯队侧翼伏击，生擒哥哥罗伯特，终结这场诺曼底争夺战。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中世纪史</span><span class=\"tag\">诺曼底</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Briefing Chat: Is DNA repair the secret to a long life? Whales and mole-rats offer tantalizing hints dormant virus double-strand break CIRBP (cold-inducible RNA-binding protein) Sirt6 Fucoidan NAD+\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-07-naturepod-长新冠或源于休眠病毒-dna修复或为长寿关键/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/15a972da91ae970c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">13:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0807</span></div>\n<h2>DNA修复才是长寿关键：弓头鲸的修复蛋白已进入人体试验</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究显示近半数新冠住院患者体内潜伏病毒被再激活，一年后炎症和细胞损伤更高；而弓头鲸等长寿动物的共同点不是抑癌基因，而是更强的DNA修复能力，相关药物已进入人体试验。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">长新冠</span><span class=\"tag\">潜伏病毒</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"WarTalk: Out of Ammo for Real + Are CCAs Dumb? CCA (Collaborative Combat Aircraft) AUKUS standoff munitions porcupine strategy man-unmanned teaming\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-07-chinatalk-美伊战争打光了打中国的弹药-日本开始准备独自扛/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4db31a40ea9a2794-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0807</span></div>\n<h2>美伊战争打光了打中国的弹药，日本开始准备独自扛</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国把为对华战争储备的远程弹药几乎全打在了伊朗，中东基地准备放弃，日本因此改写防卫战略、准备先自己扛一段时间。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">国防</span><span class=\"tag\">弹药库存</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"How to Disagree With Your Kids Without Fighting HEAR framework curiosity sandwich false polarization hedging\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-07-raisinggh-别只让孩子换位思考-要让他看见你在听/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/41f3114355314dc3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">55:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0807</span></div>\n<h2>别教孩子共情，先让他看见你在听</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">让孩子学会好好分歧，关键不是教共情或换位思考，而是用语言证明你在听；HEAR 框架和好奇三明治可以立刻用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">亲子沟通</span><span class=\"tag\">分歧</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"What does a parent owe their child? PGT-A polygenic testing pleiotropy satisficing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-07-grayarea-胚胎筛选-父母该为孩子做到哪一步/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/77b28234367aefc8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">27:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Gray Area</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0807</span></div>\n<h2>筛选胚胎不是尽一切可能，是道德绑架</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">基因筛选能降低疾病风险，但统计意义常被夸大，且可能加剧社会不平等。父母应追求「足够好」而非「最优」，警惕商业公司的道德绑架。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">基因筛选</span><span class=\"tag\">生育伦理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Weight of Fame: A Hollywood Tragedy lipectomy fen-phen primary pulmonary hypertension (PPH)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-07-cautionary-制片厂的合同里写着-女演员的身体不得改变/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">41:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0807</span></div>\n<h2>女演员合同锁死体重：增重即违约，减肥即送命</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1920 年代女演员 Molly 因体重增加被片方雪藏、走上手术台；1990 年代新娘 Mary 因减肥药芬芬丧命。当身体成为商业资产，惩罚与捷径都通向同一个结局。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">好莱坞</span><span class=\"tag\">身体标准</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Why did AMD just buy this REALLY WEIRD chip company? SRAM reticle size agentic AI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-techtechpotato-amd收购talus-押注模型定制芯片的未来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0d473494a95916b2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">16:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TechTechPotato</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>AMD收购Talus：把AI模型烧进芯片，每秒跑1.7万token</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AMD收购了Talus，一家为特定AI模型定制芯片、实现每秒17,000 tokens的初创公司。这标志着AI推理走向非可编程、模型专用芯片的方向。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI芯片</span><span class=\"tag\">AMD</span>\n</div></div></a>"]